---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
// Field data services moved here from /services/ on 2026-09-25. Part 107 language changed
// to "in progress"; no paid flight operations are offered until the certificate is in hand.
---

<Layout
  title="Field Data"
  description="Drone photogrammetry, LiDAR scanning, and GIS analysis, processed in-house — Portland, Oregon and the Pacific Northwest"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero-topo section bg-gradient-to-b from-dark-bg via-dark-surface to-dark-bg">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Field Data</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary">
          The lab side of Cascadia Systems: field data collection and spatial data products for
          property owners, builders, engineering and surveying firms, and public agencies. Every
          pipeline runs on infrastructure we own, and the methods are written up in the
          <a href="/research/" class="link">lab notes</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Lines -->
  <section class="section border-t border-dark-border">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-accent-blue">Aerial Mapping &amp; Photogrammetry</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-text-secondary">
            Drone-captured imagery processed into georeferenced orthomosaic maps, digital elevation
            models, and textured 3D reconstructions. Suited to site documentation, earthwork and
            stockpile estimation, and planning work.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
            Deliverables: GeoTIFF orthomosaics · elevation models · dense point clouds · textured meshes ·
            processing report with accuracy notes
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-accent-cyan">LiDAR Scanning &amp; 3D Modeling</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-text-secondary">
            Ground-based 3D LiDAR capture of structures, sites, and interiors, including spaces
            aerial photogrammetry can't reach. Scans are registered with SLAM processing and
            delivered as point clouds or cleaned, measurable 3D models.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
            Deliverables: registered point clouds (LAS/PLY) · cleaned meshes · dimensioned model views
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-accent-purple">GIS &amp; Spatial Analysis</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-text-secondary">
            Analysis and cartography built on captured or existing data: change detection, terrain
            and viewshed analysis, corridor studies, and custom mapping. Grounded in graduate
            training in geography and spatial analysis.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
            Deliverables: analysis reports · print and web maps · GIS-ready data layers
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-dashed">
          <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-secondary">Aerial Inspection, Photo &amp; Video</h2>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-purple/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-accent-purple">
              Pending certification
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">
            Roof and structure documentation, construction progress capture, and commercial aerial
            photo and video will be offered once FAA Part 107 certification is complete. We do not
            accept paid flight work before then.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card border-dashed">
          <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-secondary">Geophysical Survey &amp; Custom Sensing</h2>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent-purple/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-accent-purple">
              In Development
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">
            Drone magnetometry for mineral exploration and custom sensor integration are on the
            lab's development roadmap. If you have a sensing problem that doesn't fit a standard
            service, we're interested in talking about it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work -->
  <section class="section bg-dark-surface">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold">How We Work</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          <p>
            Every job starts with a scoping conversation: what question the data needs to answer,
            what accuracy it requires, and what format it has to arrive in. From there we plan the
            capture, scan the site, process everything in-house, and deliver the products along
            with notes on methodology and accuracy limits.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-text-primary">Your data stays with us.</strong> Imagery and scan
            data are not uploaded to third-party cloud platforms. For public agencies and clients
            with data-governance requirements, we can document the full chain of custody from
            capture to delivery.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Compliance -->
  <section class="section border-t border-dark-border">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold">Compliance &amp; Safety</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-accent-blue">FAA Part 107</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
              Certification is in progress. Until it is complete, no paid flight operations are
              offered. Ground-based LiDAR, GIS analysis, and processing of client-supplied imagery
              are available now.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-accent-cyan">Lightweight by Design</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
              Our primary aerial platform weighs under 250 grams, a deliberate choice that reduces
              risk to people and property while still producing mapping-grade imagery.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
          <strong class="text-text-secondary">Scope note:</strong> our deliverables are mapping and
          documentation products, not boundary or legal surveys. We are not licensed Professional
          Land Surveyors; where certified survey control or legally recorded results are required,
          we work with or under a licensed PLS.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section bg-dark-surface">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Start a Conversation</h2>
        <p class="mb-8 text-text-secondary">
          Tell us about the site, the question you need answered, and the deliverable you have in
          mind.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
